{"v3_e5610f82897da16821b3aedd":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐賀県出身 19歳 佐藤愛桜です🌸"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16th Single BACKS楽曲\n「自称バレエダンサー」のMVが公開されました🩰"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん見て頂けましたか~??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobi8ze2M.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobpJ0u7C.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思い描いている自分になれなかったり\n理想に近づくにはどうするべきなのか分からなかったり\nどうしてこんなにも未熟なのだろと哀れんで何もかもどうでもよくなってしまったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分に対して葛藤を抱えながら過ごす時間も少なからずあると思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「未来とか理想なんて若い頃の幻\n静かに遠ざかってくもの 妥協しなさい\nそれも生きるってことだ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1番印象に残っている歌詞で、とても考えさせられた部分です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢を諦めることが大人になることなのかな？\n大人になれば理想よりも現実に目を向けてしまうのかな？\nいつか妥協という選択を選んでしまう自分がいるのかな？\nなんて思ったりして、色々考えてしまいます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、歌詞を何度も読んでいくうちに理想と現実の間で、もがき続けることもそう悪くない。むしろ成長できるチャンスだと教えてくれた気がします😌"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初は、”なりたい自分”になんかなれない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中盤では、”なりたい自分”は忘れられない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後は、”なりたい自分”になんかなれない\nなれなくていい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この歌詞も考えさせられる所で、好きな部分です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この楽曲の素晴らしさを全身で表現できるように、今からステージでパフォーマンスできる事をイメージするだけでワクワクします☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんの前で披露できる日を楽しみにしています！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mob2RV9xF.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"センターを務められている小田倉さん🎻\n撮影中に、小田倉さんの表情を見て何度も心を奪われました！\n隣で踊ることができてすごく嬉しいです☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobzNPAPu.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも声をかけて下さるひかりさん🦋\nこの日も「一緒に写真撮ろ~」と話しかけて下さりました！\nすごく嬉しかったです！ありがとうございます☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mob32dUcj.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りかさん♡\nBACKS LIVE!!のリハーサル期間、何度も頭をなでなでして下さったり、優しいお言葉を沢山かけて下さったり。りかさんの優しさに触れた時はなぜだか涙が止まりませんでした🥲気にかけて下さりありがとうございました！😭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobsAzSIV.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっぴり不思議でお話が面白いひなさん🧸\nひなとお話している時、そういう考えもあるのか！と思う瞬間が沢山ありますし、とにかく楽しいです☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobKcBLbK.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シンメのちー🐥⸒⸒\nオリジナル楽曲でのシンメは初めてです☺︎\nいつか隣でパフォーマンスできたらなと思っていたので嬉しいです( *´꒳`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobiS1COf.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ももちゃん🍑\nどんな時でも本当に最年少??と疑ってしまいます！本当にしっかりしています！\n頼りにしております！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobMmCKlj.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobhwjhwj.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mob59n88y.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobXKnA4S.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自称バレエダンサーが1人でも多くの方に届きますように🍀⋆゜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで見て頂きありがとうございました☺︎"}],"source":"official"},"sba-nogi-65024":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたが新年になりました✧　\n2022年もよろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ7DDD7V3647EFTTRRD16N4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">　"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨年は沢山の事を学び新たな経験を得て　\n更なる高みを目指す変化の年となりました。　\nそして沢山の思い出も溢れ、　\nとても充実したあっという間の1年間でした。　\n　\n　\nそんな中迎えた2022年、　\n年末年始も舞台の稽古漬けでした。　\n今年の芝居初めは舞台「夜明けのうた」です。　\n早いもので明後日の13日が初日です！　\n昨年の延期を得て、やっと幕開けに近づけました！　\n新年早々にお芝居に触れられて嬉しい限りです。　\n　\nまだまだ今年は楽しみな事も沢山なので　\n皆さんにも楽しみにして頂けたら。　\n　\n　\n　\n今年は昨年よりも　\nステップアップした場所へ行けるように　\n自分自身と　\nその場所に相応しい人物となれるように　\n日々精進していきます。　\n　\n本年もよろしくお願い致します！　\n　\n　\n乃木坂成人式の写真は全員とツーショット撮ったのでまた後日改めて載せますね。　\n　\n　\n　\n　\n　\n中村麗乃　"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-33951":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"HELLO"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーみんなとお寿司屋さんに食べに行ったの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなたくさん食べるんだけどドンドンみんなお腹いっぱいなって帰って行っちゃうの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやとまりかとみりあが最後の最後まで残ってお寿司たくさん食べてるんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやとまりかのお寿司は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャリの上にネタが5枚ぐらい乗ってたりして‥それを永遠食べてて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べたね〜って言いながら端っこの方見たら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お店って各席にガリが置いてあるじゃない？そのガリの箱沢山並べてガリだけ食べてて‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まっちゅんどしたのー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って聞いたら まっちゅんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「今野さんに松村は食べすぎるから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お寿司食べるなって言われたからずっとガリ食べてんねん」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな夢を見ました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこの前はおみやげでラーメンを貰ったから、お父さんがラーメン好きだから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喜ぶかなぁって思って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おみあげで持って帰ってあげようと思って大事にカバン入れてたから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみちゃんがね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「えいっ！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってラーメンの面になる部分！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのパリパリのところを手で潰してきて‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「やめてよー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ったら「ごめんごめん」って笑ってたの...涙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから夢の場面が変わって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやがかずみんと話してたら、また あみちゃんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隠れて麺のところ潰してて(･_･;"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね、なんかあみちゃんが隠れてやってるから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やめて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなんかわからんけど言えなくて‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、まあやがヘアメイクして楽屋戻ってきたら またまた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみちゃんが...まあやのカバンからラーメン取り出して麺のところバキバキつぶしてて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごい悲しくなった夢を見たよ‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていう今日のブログは まあやの夢でした〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/16/2504317/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.git